    {
      "_id": "lx2vise000000001",
      "name": "Vise Grip",
      "type": "action",
      "img": "icons/svg/combat.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The pilot hit a Medium or smaller creature with a Hydraulic Claw this turn.</p><p>The clamp closes and locks. The target is <strong>grabbed</strong> by that arm until the end of the pilot's next turn or until it Escapes (DC 20). While a creature is held, that arm can't be used for Hydraulic Claw.</p><p>If the pilot spends 1 action to Sustain the grip, the target takes @Damage[(1d8+4)[bludgeoning]] as the clamp tightens and the grab extends to the end of the pilot's next turn.</p>"
        },
