    {
      "_id": "lx2shear00000001",
      "name": "Shear",
      "type": "action",
      "img": "icons/svg/sword.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Reach</strong> 10 feet</p><p>Both clamps close on a single target and wrench in opposite directions, the same motion used to strip plating off a wreck. Make one melee attack roll: [[/r 1d20+11 #Shear]]{+11}. This counts as two attacks for the multiple attack penalty.</p><p><strong>Damage</strong> @Damage[(3d8+4)[slashing]]</p><p>Shear ignores 5 points of the target's Hardness, or 10 points if the target is an object, vehicle, or construct.</p><p><strong>Requirements</strong> Neither arm is holding a creature or object.</p>"
        },
